<section aria-labelledby="description-title">
    <h2 id="description-title">Project Description</h2>
    <p>RateMyDiningHall is a web application designed to help UC San Diego students review and discover campus dining options.</p>

    <article>
        <h3>Implementation</h3>
        <p>The project uses React, TypeScript, GraphQL, and MongoDB to manage dining hall information and reviews.</p>
    </article>

    <article>
        <h3>Impact</h3>
        <p>The application aims to make dining information easier for students to access and compare based on their dietary needs.</p>
    </article>
